WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.583
- Gurgle…gurgle?

00:00:01.958 --> 00:00:03.916
- Gurgle, gurgle. Gurgle, gurgle.

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:06.916
- My whole team is out, and we’re forced to start guys from the Baltimore Orioles.

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:08.916
- Please! We can barely play baseball.

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:10.916
- We need you to play spoiler.

00:00:10.916 --> 00:00:13.666
- Good thing this year the Delaware Clams are unlimited.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:17.083
- What?
- What does that mean?
- Like breadsticks?

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:22.958
- As coach of the Clams, I know it may take us a decade to be ready—

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:23.291
- Next!

00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:26.041
- LET’S TRY EVEN THOUGH IT DOESN’T MATTER!

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:26.791
- WOOO!
- YEAH!

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:31.416
- Everyone! Stop getting distracted by Davis Mills!

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:32.791
First up: Spoil the Dolphins.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:34.541
- I’m so proud of us. We’re finally a team—

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:38.458
- Hi, Miami, it’s little ol' Russell Wilson. Perhaps you could trade for me?

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:39.208
- HELL YEAH.

00:00:39.208 --> 00:00:40.416
- Then we take on the Colts.

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:44.166
- All right, men, it's easy. We beat the Jags, and we're in the playoffs. Sleep well.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:48.208
- [Whispering:] Carson, do something wacky.

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:49.291
- I've had a vision!

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:50.791
- Then we finish off the Browns.

00:00:51.458 --> 00:00:53.083
Huh, guess the Browns took care of themselves.

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:54.916
Hey, how are the fans in New York?

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:56.458
- Don't come. They're so mean.

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:57.791
- Then we celebrate with a photo—

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.958
- [Voice alarm:] HEADQUARTERS BREACHED, PREPARE TO CLAM UP.

00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:04.666
- Give me one good reason why I shouldn’t bite off every one of your f--king heads.

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:15.583
- This truce won’t last forever, Teamy. I will end you. 

00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.958
- ONLY I GET TO KILL YOU, YA HEAR?

00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:26.500
MARK MY WORDS: THE ONLY THING THE WASHINGTON FOOTBALL TEAM WILL BE RENAMED

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.083
IS THE DELAWARE F--KING CLAMS.

